WEBVTT

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:10.900
On that fateful day seventeen years ago,

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:17.170
we sealed away a man who sought to
bring ruin upon the world.

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:22.340
Tatsuma, victory would not have been
ours had not your father, Genma,

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:24.170
sacrificed his life in the process.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:27.770
Hiyu's father...

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:32.780
It was just after I had sent you
to Magami that I sensed

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:38.690
a disturbance in the Dragon Stream that was the
same as the one from seventeen years ago,

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:41.590
and set out for a certain ravine.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:47.270
And I fell victim to my own carelessness.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:50.470
I never once suspected that he
had recovered his powers.

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:53.340
I just barely managed to survive,

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:55.740
and it was months before I was able
to move about on my own again.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.370
Just a moment!

00:00:57.610 --> 00:00:59.240
Then...

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:01.680
Then for all that time...

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:03.770
All those people we killed were...

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:17.690
This fateful conflict transcends time
and is about to reignite in Tokyo.

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:23.870
Individuals bearing the Stars of Fate
have been born into all ages,

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:28.200
and have inexorably taken up their own
parts in the eternal struggle.

00:01:28.970 --> 00:01:33.580
The rebellion of the Kozunu clan,
the birth of the Demoniacal Horde...

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.340
These things were all orchestrated
in the shadows by that man!

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:42.220
He's probably the one who gave
Tendo Kozunu his powers too,

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:46.090
and who manipulated the Martial Fist
into attacking all of you.

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:48.890
You're saying he revived and did this?

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:53.930
So then, who is this guy anyway?

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.740
Munetaka Yagyu...

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:08.010
Munetaka Yagyu?

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:21.120
The Fifth Night

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:22.490
Martial Fist Chapter

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:25.700
The Protecting Fist

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:32.040
Fujian Province?

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.130
No...

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:37.000
I don't know.

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.310
Oh, my god!

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:45.720
Whoa, these... these are the legendary
Mommy Strawberries (Version 2.5),

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.480
that Cleopatra herself thought were totally delish,

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:51.360
that cost like a thousand yen per berry!

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:52.590
They ain't for you!

00:02:52.590 --> 00:02:55.230
C..C..C..C'mon! What's your problem?

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:57.930
They're presents from Hiyu's parents,
aren't they?

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:02.200
As manager of the Demonbuster Club, I also
have full eating privileges on those str...

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:03.970
This ain't no club.

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:07.470
Is that any kind of attitude to have after making
me worry about you guys day in and day out?

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:10.940
How about paying me back for the past
few days? With those strawberries.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:11.610
Forget it.

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:12.610
Strawberries!
Forget it.

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:13.550
No way.

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:14.550
Just one!
No way.

00:03:14.550 --> 00:03:15.380
Not happening.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.450
Not happening?!
Not happening.

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:18.320
If you keep being so stingy...

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:21.520
That bastard comes back no matter
how many times we beat him.

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:22.950
He's a real tough customer.

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:25.320
What is he after us for?

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:29.150
Because you bear the Stars of Fate.

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:32.500
Those with the Stars of Fate

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:38.300
have fought him countless times
throughout history.

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:40.740
In comparatively recent times,
during the Bakumatsu,

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:42.970
as well as seventeen years ago.

00:03:42.970 --> 00:03:47.500
Huh? Does that mean you two are
also under the Stars of Fate?

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:49.710
Talk about slow...

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:51.810
You just realized that now?

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:54.290
So what?!

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:56.990
Look at you, showin' up late and
acting like you're all that!

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:58.360
So, what's the rest of the story?

00:03:58.360 --> 00:03:59.980
Now he ignores me?!

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:05.130
See, he's been betrayed time and time again.

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:07.130
So, I'll bet he used Kozunu and the Martial Fist

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:10.600
to try to kill you guys.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:15.130
Before you could realize the full
extent of your powers.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.110
Munetaka Yagyu...

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:20.340
He's the real enemy!

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:22.570
What do we do now?

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.350
Like that's even a question!

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:27.110
This is getting interesting.

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.460
The guy who's been pulling the strings
finally showed himself.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.980
So, let's give him our warmest welcome.

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:34.390
Right?

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:35.460
You...

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.930
Good grief, such a simpleton...

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:40.270
If we...

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:42.670
If we take down this Yagyu guy...

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:47.830
It will end; the battle will be over!

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:51.270
Strawberries!

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:53.780
Just... just a bite!

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:55.980
You've got a whole bunch!

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:58.350
Well, see you around, Kyochee.

00:04:58.350 --> 00:04:59.980
Don't call me that!

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:03.320
You are all beautiful.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.650
It's enough to make me jealous.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:17.400
When the order of society is disrupted,
so is the Dragon Stream.

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:24.340
I founded the Martial Fist to help prevent such
disruptions in the Dragon Stream.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:27.480
I understand how you feel.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:31.110
I do not think what has been
done is forgivable either.

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:34.180
However...

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:37.250
I understand.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.780
But...

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:43.220
But...

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:48.770
It's sad, isn't it?

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:59.780
Jeez, that was pretty damn reckless
to go off and do on your own.

00:06:00.550 --> 00:06:02.810
I am truly sorry.

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:06.750
Well, I guess that's one thing I like about you.

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:10.680
It seems you have not changed
in all these years.

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:15.360
Tatsuma knows the whole story now, huh?

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:25.700
Seventeen years ago, I entrusted him to a couple
who happened to live in that place.

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:33.300
I hoped he would go on to live the ordinary,
happy life they never got the chance to.

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:40.410
It was something I would have had
to tell him sooner or later.

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:42.680
About Genma...

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:45.960
And about me.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:51.160
You think he can make it through this?

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.630
Listen, Narutaki...

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:56.970
Now that Yagyu is once again on the move,

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:02.070
I do not think that assassinating him will make it
possible to calm the Dragon Stream at this point.

00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:07.380
We objected when you wanted to
start the Martial Fist,

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:10.950
but you wouldn't hear of it.

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:16.020
I don't think there's any other way we can
repay Genma for laying down his life.

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:22.960
Isn't this enough already?
I'm sure he'd agree too.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:25.560
This is a problem that concerns
more than just me.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:28.900
There are a number of youngsters

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:32.500
who trust me, who have followed me.

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:36.370
They all bear the weight of their
own thoughts and feelings,

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:39.830
and are all trying to carry out
their own vision of justice.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:45.080
But I took their feelings and...

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:53.580
Mother...

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:58.130
If anything goes wrong, I have
asked for the Director's help.

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:04.240
Wake her up! Wake my mother up!

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:06.000
Cut it out, Kureha!
Wake her up! Wake her up!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.170
Kureha!

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:10.070
Wake her up!

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:15.580
Sheesh, a pain to the bitter end!

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:17.880
Parent-child relationships sure
can be hard to understand.

00:08:17.880 --> 00:08:20.550
Kureha acted like that even after all
the trouble she put him through.

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:23.150
Stop it, big brother!
How can you say that now?

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:24.990
But it's true ain't it?

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:28.030
She neglected her kid to
run off with some guy.

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:30.400
Enough already!

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.060
Sorry...

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:33.500
But what now?

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:36.000
They're saying they'll pay the settlement.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.200
They'll look after her to the end too.

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.840
So, he just has to cry himself to sleep?!

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:42.470
What else can you do?

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:44.940
Who's gonna take care of the kid?

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:47.550
So, say we lose the trial.

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:50.480
You think we got the means
to take care of him?

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:53.340
But still...

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:00.050
Director...

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:02.390
I have a favor to ask.

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:15.970
Ms. Alucard, calling Ms. Alucard.

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:18.480
Please report to the staff room.

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:22.110
Ms. Alucard, calling Ms. Alucard.

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:24.640
Please report to the staff room.

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:26.750
Misato?

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:31.060
Oh, Hiyu, why are you here so late?

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:32.590
Well...

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.490
What about you?

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:36.030
Student Council stuff.

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:38.560
The underclassmen wanted some advice.

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:40.190
Ah...

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:43.900
But I'm all done with that now.

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:46.340
The Student Council is all theirs now.

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:48.810
I see...

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:50.380
Yeah...

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:51.940
Is it?

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.770
Yeah, it is.

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:03.080
Um, Hiyu?

00:10:08.430 --> 00:10:11.090
Oh, nothing.

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:14.170
I'll see you tomorrow.

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:18.070
See you tomorrow.

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:26.080
Ms. Alucard, calling Ms. Alucard.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:29.380
Um, I'm sitting here waiting.

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:31.850
Could you hurry it up?

00:10:32.850 --> 00:10:36.050
Huh? Now how do you turn
this thing off again?

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:03.820
Casting judgment upon people

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:07.080
and denying them the infinite possibilities
of life is unforgivable!

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:11.390
Director...

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:13.190
I have a favor to ask.

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:17.390
Allow me... to fight him.

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:20.390
To fight Tatsuma Hiyu.

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:30.510
"We decided we wanted to go somewhere."

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:37.910
"So Hiyu and the others came along,
and we all went on a little runaway trip."

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:39.880
Ms. Alucard?

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:41.490
I guess it makes sense.

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:47.390
I suppose, at your age, kids might
feel like doing that on a whim.

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:50.250
But...

00:11:50.630 --> 00:11:52.790
Is that really all there was to it?

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:55.300
I...

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:58.100
I'm sorry! Pardon me!

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:07.070
"How beautiful, the strength of these
bonds between people's hearts."

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:09.740
Jeez...

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.880
Dear Hiyums,

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:18.060
The date has been set for your
father's exhibition.

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:20.590
I'm sending an invitation with this letter,

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.750
so please be sure to stop by.

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:33.500
I was so relieved after seeing you in Tokyo.

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.570
You seem to be doing well,

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:40.010
and most important of all,
you've made lots of good friends.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:44.480
There's Horaiji...

00:12:45.350 --> 00:12:46.980
Misato...

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.080
Sakurai and...

00:12:49.520 --> 00:12:51.260
Daigo...

00:12:51.260 --> 00:12:54.160
Oh, and Anko too.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:13:00.530
I was surprised to see what
nice kids they all are.

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:05.230
So, have you made any other new friends?

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:12.510
Please invite all of your friends
to the exhibition, okay?

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:21.210
I'm sending some strawberries too,
so share them with your friends.

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:27.850
Your father and I are looking forward
to seeing everyone again.

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:34.530
Do you remember, Hiyums?

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:39.070
How hard it was for you to make friends
when you were little?

00:13:39.070 --> 00:13:41.870
It was so sad for you.

00:13:43.570 --> 00:13:47.240
Remember what your father said then?

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:58.690
It's you!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.760
I 'm glad you're okay.

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:03.060
Shut up!

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:04.830
It's all your fault...

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:07.730
It's your fault Lord Yagyu kicked me out!

00:14:07.730 --> 00:14:10.290
It's your fault for killing Kozunu!

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:15.700
If I kill you,

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:18.380
then I'm sure...

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:20.810
I'm sure Lord Yagyu will forgive me!

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:12.430
You jerk!

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.630
Where'd he go?!

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:24.210
Why would you take it so far?

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:25.880
Shut up!

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:28.010
You'd never understand!

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.750
Lord Yagyu's all that I've got!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:33.550
If I can't even return to him, then...

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:36.550
I might as well...

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:38.550
Really?

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:43.150
Then why don't you be friends
with me from now on?

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:47.060
Yeah, right.

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:49.730
Don't think you can fool me
with your gross ideas.

00:15:49.730 --> 00:15:50.940
Okay, see you around then.

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:52.560
Wait!

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:55.470
I was so glad

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:58.830
when Kyouichi started taking me on.

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:02.840
I'd always felt like I was being avoided,

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:05.980
and I thought it was fine that way.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.950
But I guess it is

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:12.450
pretty lonesome being on
your own after all, huh?

00:16:18.900 --> 00:16:22.860
Hiyu Tatsuma, Lord Tatsuma...

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:29.170
Marie Hiyu?

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:31.140
Tatsuma Claire?

00:16:31.810 --> 00:16:33.780
Now which sounds better?

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:39.080
I'm glad you came.

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:42.110
Why do you kill?

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:45.320
For great justice.

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:45.590
Dang er!
No Tresspassing
Maritime Safety Agency
Maritime Safety Agency District 3 Headquarters

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:48.290
Dan g er!
No Tresspassing
Maritime Safety Agency
Maritime Safety Agency District 3 Headquarters
You kill for that?

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.490
D an g er!
No Tresspassing
Maritime Safety Agency
Maritime Safety Agency District 3 Headquarters
I've said this before:

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:55.290
There are people in the world who live without
any restraint, committing evil deeds,

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:59.200
and there are people who can do
nothing but weep silent tears.

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:03.570
Evil cannot be defeated with
idealistic thinking.

00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:08.150
Do you really believe that even now?

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:13.780
I wanted to settle things with you,

00:17:14.890 --> 00:17:17.020
both as a member of the Martial Fist,

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:20.750
and as a martial artist.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:24.090
I have the Director's permission.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:29.160
Fight me in earnest this time.

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:43.110
Do you remember, Hiyums?

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:48.190
How hard it was for you to make
friends when you were little?

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:51.310
It was so sad for you.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:57.580
Remember what your father said then?

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.230
H iyu ms...

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:04.170
You know you have a power that's

00:18:04.170 --> 00:18:07.400
just a little bit different from
other kids, don't you?

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:09.640
But you know what?

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:13.630
Someday, you will need that power.

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:20.210
You see, it's a power for bringing
happiness to everyone.

00:18:27.360 --> 00:18:31.900
Yes, there is power in this hand.

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:39.360
The power to protect all the
people you've met so far,

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:44.260
and all the people you're going to meet.

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.280
Why don't you follow through?

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:35.280
I thought as much.

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:37.550
Why?

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:40.000
Why do you behave this way?

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:44.960
Because...

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:49.500
Because I use my fists to protect.

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:55.840
You are just like your father.

00:19:57.720 --> 00:20:03.980
Your father also fought, and died,
for other people's sakes.

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:07.590
We were fellow pupils of the same master.

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:12.520
The style I have taught you is
your father, Genma's.

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:18.970
And you, Kureha, I taught you my own style.

00:20:18.970 --> 00:20:26.000
Tatsuma, your father's style was not
in any way an assassin's art.

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:31.270
Just like you, he fought to protect lives.

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:34.940
It is the fist of life.

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:44.660
My mom and dad said he was a great guy.

00:20:46.230 --> 00:20:47.860
I see.

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:52.100
They said you are a good person too.

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:58.940
And I agree with them.

00:20:59.580 --> 00:21:01.200
Tatsuma!

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:04.140
Thank you very much.

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:12.350
You wanted to the know the answer, right?

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:19.920
There was no doubt behind
the fist of Tatsuma Hiyu.

00:21:20.330 --> 00:21:24.060
Did you think you'd find your answers
by fighting Tatsuma?

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:28.170
I've lost my own understanding of things.

00:21:29.610 --> 00:21:33.380
Is what he said right?

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:36.810
That those who have committed misdeeds
have a right to live?

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:40.780
People who do evil are capable
of changing their ways?

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:43.590
I should let these people live?

00:21:43.590 --> 00:21:45.710
But that would be...

00:21:46.360 --> 00:21:51.020
I have decided to suspend the Martial Fist's
activities for a time.

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:58.100
I thought I was leading you all
down the right path,

00:21:58.100 --> 00:22:00.800
but it seems that was a mistake.

00:22:00.800 --> 00:22:02.270
Director...

00:22:02.270 --> 00:22:05.810
I've just told the others.

00:22:05.810 --> 00:22:11.720
Leave me now, and pursue your
own individual training.

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:15.720
See with your own eyes,
think your own thoughts,

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:19.220
and find your own justice.

00:22:19.220 --> 00:22:21.380
My own justice...

00:22:22.130 --> 00:22:24.390
And do not die before you do.

00:22:27.800 --> 00:22:31.040
Eventually, you will have a chance
to atone for your sins.

00:22:31.040 --> 00:22:34.610
Until that time comes, do not die,
no matter what.

00:22:34.610 --> 00:22:38.870
That is the Martial Fist's final mission.

00:22:41.010 --> 00:22:42.740
You're right.

00:22:43.410 --> 00:22:46.470
Someday, for sure...

00:22:48.320 --> 00:22:50.290
And don't you worry.

00:22:52.290 --> 00:22:56.160
Your mother will be all right.

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:59.160
Welcome, it's nice to meet you.

00:22:59.160 --> 00:23:03.030
I'll be working with you
starting today, Mrs. Mibu.

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:06.200
Thanks, Kyouichi.

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:10.430
Don't be silly, I was just out for a walk.

00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:13.000
All the way out here?

00:23:13.440 --> 00:23:16.980
Yeah! I walked my ass off,
and now I'm starvin'!

00:23:16.980 --> 00:23:18.740
You up for some ramen or whatever?

00:23:19.780 --> 00:23:21.410
Sure.

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:27.560
There's someone I want to protect.

00:23:29.330 --> 00:23:34.790
So, just a little longer, until this
fight's over at least.

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:40.640
Someday, I promise I'll come to you.

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:42.270
So...

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:46.080
So...

00:23:46.080 --> 00:23:47.700
Forgive me!

00:23:48.610 --> 00:23:50.770
Forgive me!

